  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>You take the full blast to your chest, shrapnel and shot puncturing both lungs! You cough blood and gasp for air as your respiratory apparatus collapses. With the pleural spaces filling with air and blood there’s no room for your lungs to expand to draw in that life-sustaining oxygen!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Prone] and @Condition[Broken]. Also gain @Condition[Fatigued] (4), which for healing purposes will be treated as a Torn Muscle (Major) with partial healing reducing your Conditions from @Condition[Fatigued] (4) to @Condition[Fatigued] (2). However, even when fully healed you’ll still have @Condition[Fatigued] (1) which will be permanent.</p>"
    },
